 a DOCX.</p></template><p v-else class="notice">资料未采用或待复核，未决定实际改文。 / Facts are unadopted or require review; no amendment decided.</p><button class="btn" @click="focusSource">在原件核对位置与规则 / Inspect source location and rule</button></template></article><aside><h3>未决及追踪<span class="en">Unresolved items and traceability</span></h3><ul><li><button class="text-link" @click="openReview()">模板{{ reviewCount?.unconfirmed ?? '—' }}项未确认 / Template records awaiting confirmation</button></li><li v-for="key in unresolved" :key="key"><button class="text-link" @click="go(4)">{{ labels[key].zh }}：未采用或待复核<span class="en">{{ labels[key].en }}: unadopted or review required</span></button></li><li>其余图谱尚未完整求值。 / The remaining graph is not evaluated.</li><li v-if="edition === 'pdf'">SCC PDF版缺可编辑原件。 / No editable original for SCC PDF.</li></ul><button class="btn" @click="traceOpen = true">查看识别记录及原文 / Read history and source</button></aside></div>
  </section>

  <AppModal :open="traceOpen" title="离线识别记录 / Offline identification history" wide @close="traceOpen = false"><p class="notice">明确虚构来源的离线演示，未调用模型；候选纠错不会改写此前记录。<span class="en">Fictional offline example; no model called. Corrections do not rewrite these records.</span></p><h3>来源原文 / Source text</h3><pre>{{ PROJECT_SAMPLE_SOURCE_TEXT }}</pre><details v-for="run in runs" :key="run.number"><summary>第{{ run.number }}轮 / Example run {{ run.number }}</summary><article v-for="item in run.candidates" :key="item.label"><strong>{{ item.label }} · {{ valueLabel(item.value) }}</strong><blockquote>{{ item.quote }}</blockquote><p class="hint">{{ item.issue }}</p></article></details><p v-if="!runs.length">尚未演示识别。 / No offline run yet.</p></AppModal>
