  <AppModal :open="!!leaveTarget" title="离开本轮核对？ / Leave this review?" @close="leaveTarget = ''"><p>本页暂存资料、候选、采用值及示例成稿不会跨刷新保留；原件图谱请在原件页保存或下载。<span class="en">Staged files, candidates, adopted values and example text do not survive refresh. Save a Template graph in the source editor.</span></p><template #footer><button class="btn" @click="leaveTarget = ''">保留本页 / Stay here</button><button class="btn" @click="leave">继续离开 / Leave anyway</button></template></AppModal>
</section>
